ode":"MeleeCombat.aggression(of:…)"},{"text":"’s is — so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a roamer whose wandering is scoped (the thief holds still while you are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"standing in his lair) burns no randomness on the turns his gate is shut,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeping every seeded draw sequence intact. The default gate is always","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"open, so a caller that does not pass one behaves exactly as before.","type":"text"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that, with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chancePerTurn"},{"text":", moves ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"text":" to a random","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"other","type":"text"}]},{"text":" room in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rooms"},{"text":" — a teleport within the set, with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exit-graph awareness (a wall between two rooms in the set won’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stop him). Arrival\/departure lines print only when the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"room is lit and is the room being entered or left: in the dark, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a room away, movement is silent. The daemon idles (no RNG drawn)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the actor is outside ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rooms"},{"text":" — including after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"text":" —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but the host should still ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(_:)"},{"text":" on the actor’s death.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"path