,"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that keeps ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"go"},{"text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catches up the same turn and its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrival"},{"text":" line trails the room","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"departure"},{"text":" line — the companion only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"to"}]},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"text":" — and the host may ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to park the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then "},{"code":"startDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to resume."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike "},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"steals","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: "},{"code":"arrivals","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"code":"starts(in:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival on turn one."}],"title":"follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"follows"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rooms","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Location","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"when","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"arrivals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Location":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Location"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A place in the world.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/location","title":"Location","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Location"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Location"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors","title":"ActorBehaviors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Logic-only NPC behaviors: roaming, theft, canned reactions. The plugin"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"owns no entities and no state — position ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"is","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the actor’s placement —","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"so the host declares its actors and splices these factories into its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks:"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TimedEvent":{"abstract":[{"text":"A named timed event, declared in a game or bundle ","type":"text"},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block: a fuse","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(fires once, N turns after it is started) or a daemon (runs at the end of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every turn while active). The body is registered at bootstrap and never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"serialized; only the schedule — name → turns remaining, or the active"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flag — lives in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WorldState"},{"type":"text","text":", so it saves and restores like any other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state and a restore re-binds it to the declared body by name."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/timedevent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"TimedEvent","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"identifier"}]}}}